Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on The Tudors…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.03,0:00:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻我们齐聚一堂 参加亨利八世\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are come here together to join Henry VIII.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与简·西摩女士的神圣婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Lady Jane Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得她会令他快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she'll make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝 那是我们大家的福音\N{\fnArial\fs30}With God's help, we'll all be happy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将继续关怀玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I will continue to show favour to the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽·都铎小姐驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lady Mary Tudor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}允许我为您介绍简王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present you to Her Majesty, Queen Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伊丽莎白公主 - 全家团圆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Princess Elizabeth. - Je suis en famille!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若新王后如传闻所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the new queen favours the Catholic religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲睐天主教会\N{\fnArial\fs30}as she's rumoured to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.99,0:00:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们的宗教改革则岌岌可危\N{\fnArial\fs30}then our whole Reformation is surely in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须抓紧时间解散那些修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must press ahead with the dissolution of the monasteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.78,0:00:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有要事禀报 北部多数地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, we have come here to tell you that a great part of the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突然起义征讨陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}have risen in sudden rebellion against His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}血战到底 视死如归\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fight, and we will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些卑鄙小人叛乱危及我的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}These wretched men have threatened my whole realm with uproar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉我反对者甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me there was little opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.26,0:01:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说多数民众乐意看到这些地方解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me that most people were glad to see such places dissolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要好好教训这些忘恩负义的判徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll teach these bastard ingrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用一场大屠杀给他们好好上一课\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fearful bloody lesson in slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗彻福德女士 我想任命你为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Rochford, I'd like to appoint you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.86,0:01:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的首席侍女\N{\fnArial\fs30}my principal lady in waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, the King has.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王已经把米索登女士收作情妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken Lady Misseldon as a mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别为我烦恼 我有个大好的理由足以幸福了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not be troubled for me for I have great reason to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我想你是怀孕了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think you're with child. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要您去筹备我儿降生的庆祝会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to organize the celebrations for the birth of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}庆祝会要无比壮观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want them to be truly spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 王后 - 是时候了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Madam! - Is it time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求您了 夫人 别放弃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, my Lady, don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您得尽快决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty may have to decide soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是保母亲 还是保孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}between the life of the mother or of the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下产下了一名健康的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty is delivered of a healthy son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我有儿子了 - 至高无上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a son. - Right high,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}超凡卓越 高尚尊贵的爱德华王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}right excellent and noble Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后的病情在急速恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Queen's health has rapidly deteriorated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经竭尽所能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have tried everything we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:01:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后仍然越来越虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Her Majesty continues to weaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈求上帝 别把她从我身边带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, God, don't take her away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道陛下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否愿意重结姻缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}could frame your mind towards a new marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敌船来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemy ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 快点燃烽火\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Lord's sake, light the beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您正四面楚歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is beset by enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而同克里维斯的安联姻 能与新教国结成联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage to Anne of Cleves would bring with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得到军事上的大力支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}the military support of the Protestant League.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又一次成为法王与贵主陛下博弈的一颗棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to be relieved that once more I've been used as a pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该为此欣慰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a game between your master and the French King?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕受够了 查普维斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough, Mr… Chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我介绍这位 托马斯·西摩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to present my companion, Mr. Thomas Seymour,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 英格兰王后的兄弟 - 您好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- brother of the Queen of England. - Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们四面楚歌了 弗朗西斯阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems we are threatened from everywhere, Sir Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharpen your knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都都不知道我是谁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know who I am, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是爱德华·西摩的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Edward Seymour's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要感谢你 弗朗西斯阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you, Sir Francis,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以后别再碰我老婆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in future to leave my wife alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已警告过弗朗西斯·布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've warned Sir Francis Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他离你远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stay away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真遗憾 他让我很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a pity. He makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荷尔拜因先生送来了克里维斯的安的画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr… Holbein has sent this portrait of Anne of Cleves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她挺讨人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is pleasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰阁下向我隆重介绍她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir John has written to me in great praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要占有的这个女人 却从未能得一见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to possess this woman and I haven't even seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这场婚姻事关重大 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great many things hang upon this marriage, do they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:03:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若有任何差错 将太遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a pity if all should go awry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里维斯的安的事 我被欺骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been deceived about Anne of Cleves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她本人和你们说的简直天壤之别\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is nothing like what was reported to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她长得简直像匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks like a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 要不是为了平息内忧外患\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, if it were not to satisfy the world and my realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.73,0:03:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会被逼到如此地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not do what I must do this day for no earthly thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来克伦威尔大人做得太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me that Lord Cromwell has overreached himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.18,0:03:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我找到能取悦圣上的人了 - 她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have found someone to amuse the King. - Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她叫凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Miss Katherine Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你芳龄几许 凯瑟琳 - 年芳十七\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are you, Katherine? - Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被送到公爵遗孀那生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sent to live in the household of the Dowager Duchess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们玩得很疯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran a little wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 你觉得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得很适合国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she looks fit for a King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人 您因叛国罪被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Cromwell, you are arrested for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖国贼 卖国贼 卖国贼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor! Traitor! Traitor! Traitor! Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才不是卖国贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为教会首脑 您应该找到证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}As head of Church, you should find proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证明这桩婚事根本没生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the marriage was never consummated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派代表去见克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a deputation to Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他证明支持我取消婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demand of him written evidence supporting my annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔将无地自容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cromwell will be humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的野心害死了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so ambitious for others' blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在下不得不向皇帝禀报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must report to the Emperor that it has not rained.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逾时两月 此地滴雨未降\N{\fnArial\fs30}in over two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此等炎热酷暑实乃史无前例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say it is the hottest summer in living memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此一来 便令五百名\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is a great inconvenience to the 500 citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被监禁的异教徒倍感煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King has incarcerated on charges of heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下依旧刚愎自用\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty continues to demonstrate his perversity,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.57,0:05:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他时不时地会同时处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes executing both Lutherans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路德教徒和天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Catholics on the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一切都无法阻止国王追逐美色\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing deters the King from his amorous pursuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知 他已与情妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am told he is already secretly married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·霍华德秘密完婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Mistress Katherine Howard and intends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并拟于明日昭告天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show her to the world tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 卡尔佩珀先生 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Culpepper. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 罗彻福德女士 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Rochford. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不来就寝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you not come to bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lady. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正和查普维斯交谈的是何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that talking to Chapuys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诺福克的长子 萨里伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norfolk's eldest son, the Earl of Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵离开已有几年之久\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Earl's been away a few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直在法兰西培养他的骑士精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}practicing his chivalry in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说他吟诗作对 颇为放荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say he writes poetry and runs a little wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人似乎有些心不在焉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace seems somewhat distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逝者已矣 念意尚息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking of those who are no longer here to sup with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使面对吾敌 我也依然念旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a moment of nostalgia, even for my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得知托马斯·博林于近日去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand Thomas Boleyn died recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他的葬礼无人问津\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and the only mourners at his funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯有子女的亡魂哀悼哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}were the ghosts of his children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 这位是查普维斯大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, Ambassador Chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马里亚克先生 很高兴您带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Marillac, we are happy accept your credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法兰西国王的文书 欢迎来我宫中一聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}from King Francis. Welcome to our Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:09:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今日 我要向您引见我的新妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come here this day to introduce to you my new wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后的倾城美貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Katherine. I was first attracted to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令我一见倾心\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a notable appearance of honour,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有她的蕙质兰心和似水柔情\N{\fnArial\fs30}cleanness, and maidenly behaviour…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐拥如此尤物令我受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems incredible to have obtained such a perfect jewel of womanhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她赐予了我如此美妙的爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}who bears towards me such perfect love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不只带来我梦寐以求的安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A love that will not only bring me the peace and tranquility I desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还如同重获新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but may also bring forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.16,0:09:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}憧憬那美好婚姻的结晶\N{\fnArial\fs30}the desired fruits of such a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 致凯瑟琳王后 - 凯瑟琳王后千岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To Queen Katherine. - Queen Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 大家开怀畅饮吧 我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's eat! I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请允许我向您引见萨里伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, may I introduce the Earl of Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎您回到宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are very glad to welcome you back at court,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord Surrey. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我向您介绍我的新妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce my new wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.93,0:10:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 也是我的侄女\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my niece, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此说来 您就是法兰西的新任使臣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you are the new French ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马里亚克先生 在得知我王抛弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Monsieur Marillac: what did your King really say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的上一任王后 您的国王有何反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you told him His Majesty had got rid of his last Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他并未多言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he didn't say much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是深叹了口气 又感慨了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just sighed very deeply and then he said: "Ah!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想跳舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马里亚克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur Marillac.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉法兰西国王 听闻他长子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your master I was very sad to hear about the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太子殿下的死讯 我深感遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Dauphin, his eldest son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王想向您提亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty would like to propose a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他的次子 奥尔良公爵亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}between his second son, Henri, Duke of Orleans,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与您的爱女 玛丽小姐成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your daughter, the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How often it comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对一切尚不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're new to all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可知她芳龄几何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how old she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年方十七\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我俩的婚事 你可曾告知法王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told your master about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他作何反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.36,0:12:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他定是认为我疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose he thinks I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亦或只是妒火中烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else he's just plain jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王今早赐我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King sent it to me this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, ladies…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们要发誓 从今以后 谨守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must promise that from now on, as you are all sworn in,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部穿戴法式服饰 就如我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will all dress in the French fashion, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们能保证吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们乐意至极 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are more than happy to oblige, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗彻福德夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 您有一封信刚刚送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady. You have a letter, just delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所为何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 只是位旧友 琼·布尔默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing. Just an old friend, Joan Bulmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听闻我现在鸿运当头\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says that she has heard of my "Great destiny"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}望我能派人接她入宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will I please now send for her to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.73,0:14:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近日遭遇某些变故\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says that some altered circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令她「痛不欲生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}have brought her "To the utmost misery in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「只能终日顾影自怜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a most wretched life."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您会如她所愿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall you send for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自会考虑 罗彻福德夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall think on it, Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 女士们 来试试你们的新装吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, ladies, why don't we try on your new dresses!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再给你讲个法国趣事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you another amusing thing about the French.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴黎人为庆祝冬至\N{\fnArial\fs30}To celebrate the winter solstice in Paris,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会燃起篝火 放上木桶 车轮 花环和篮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}they build a bonfire and on the top of it they put a barrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}篮子里塞了两打活猫和一只狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wheel, garlands, and a basket filled with two dozen cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样活活烧死只为取悦国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a fox to be burned alive for the King's pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还真见过弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually saw King Francis himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲自用红色天鹅绒包裹的火炬点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}light it with a torch wrapped in red velvet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵 时过境迁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, my Lord Surrey, after so long away,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您对英国朝廷有何看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you find the English court?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奸佞遍布朝野\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it full of mean creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中有不少人在为陛下效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of them in the service of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伯爵所指为何人 - 那些出身卑贱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of whom do you speak? - Those men of vile birth:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}律师 大学生 玩弄权术的小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lawyers, university men, Machiavellian intriguers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们别无它求\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose only desire is the destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只欲毁掉这个高尚的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the nobility of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人皆令我憎恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是指西摩之流吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean men like the Seymours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简·西摩为国王诞下了继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One cannot forget their sister provided the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们自然对其家族感恩戴德\N{\fnArial\fs30}with an heir to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然您已回归 欲施何种抱负\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that you've returned, what are your ambitions?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}超越祖辈父辈的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}To surpass the achievements of my father and my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵大人 果真志向高远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a very high ambition, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾乃霍华德家族 理应功成名就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Howard. It is expected of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And always has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我定会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will not fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有鹿吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any deer? - No deer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 除了几只兔子和一头鹿 您今日一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, you've caught nothing all day, beyond some rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何仍笑容不减\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a deer, but you're still smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸事顺遂 自然喜由心生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I not every reason to be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也见过王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have seen the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得妻如此 夫复何求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't the man that woman gives herself to always be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 如此和乐非常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say he'd be beyond happiness, Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚是极致享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a higher state altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查尔斯 我感觉自己已脱胎换骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel almost like a new man, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不似从前那般每日为琐事烦忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no longer vexed by the things that before vexed me daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连我的腿业已慢慢痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even my leg is beginning to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}性爱的确是疗伤圣药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sex is a great medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实 您很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed. You are very fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的凯瑟琳如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your Catherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却对我情意不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although she no longer loves me as she once did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们分开已有时日 - 找个情妇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We live mostly apart. - Take a mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如有可能 我情愿令她回心转意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather make her love me again, if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.41,0:17:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我计划尽快带王后出巡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to take the Queen on a visit soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望人们能和我一样爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the people to see her as I see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 还有她的族人 萨里伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - And her kinsman, Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要封他为侍酒官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make him a cupbearer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赐予他尊荣的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give him other tokens of our esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定会感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure His Lordship will be most grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你错了 大人 他只会当是理所当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my Lord. He will merely see it as his birthright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀 上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Culpepper! Come on, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们再打点野味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have them flush us out something edible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下 助猎手出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Majesty. Beaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 玛丽公主求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty. The Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:18:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见到你令我兴奋不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives me such pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下常说起你 不 是一刻不曾忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King talks about you often. No, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.95,0:18:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}句句饱含热爱之情\N{\fnArial\fs30}With such affection…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真切希望你我能相处融洽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my dearest wish that you and I may be kind and loving…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}母慈女孝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and warm to each other…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主 毕竟你现在是我的继女\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, Lady Mary, you are now my stepdaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论何时您决定召见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall attend upon Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都会伴其左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever Your Majesty chooses to invite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.48,0:19:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小坐一下吧 我的侍女做了蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stay a while? My maids have made some cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不了 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝您好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的旧友 琼·布尔默小姐到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old friend is here: Miss Joan Bulmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以置信 摇身一变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not the luckiest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已成为世上最幸运和富有的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}most fortunate woman in all the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 琼 我 - 你见到我不开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joan, I… - Are you not pleased to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们以前如此亲密 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to be so close, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 我一直对你真心实意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the unfeigned love my heart has always borne towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会给我安排差事的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to give me a position, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会 但你要理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may. But you must understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我就只得深陷痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise I must persist in my wretchedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法脱离苦海\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会抛下我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you will not turn me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得从前常来的那个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember when you-know-who used to come in,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在夜阑人静之时 潜入香闺\N{\fnArial\fs30}late at night… and slip into bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝份上 当心祸从口出\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, be careful what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就把我留下 你会的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will make me one of your ladies, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Katherine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:20:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 法国边境的动乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, there are new reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.81,0:21:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又有最新消息 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}of disturbances in France. Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驻守阿德尔的法军守军\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a quarrel between the French garrison at Ardres.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.98,0:21:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与我方圭尼斯的军队起了冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our own at Guisnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法军在阿德尔建立城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French built a castle at Ardres.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又建起通往加来的桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then a bridge into the Pale of Calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我军将桥砍断 不料法军竟随即重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}When our soldiers pulled it down, the French.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我要让法国明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}promptly rebuilt it. Now, I mean to show these French.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胆敢恣意挑衅 我定以战争还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I will not shy away from battle if I am provoked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为表此意 我将派汤姆·西摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}For reasons which I am sending.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和萨里伯爵前往加来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Seymour and the Earl of Surrey to Calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位将前往驻军地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will bring with them from the garrison,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}军队与大炮随行\N{\fnArial\fs30}men and ordnance and they.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在阿德尔摆开阵营\N{\fnArial\fs30}will make a show of force before Ardres.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此情形下 法国要么乖乖求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case the French must either decide to desist…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么等着开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}or fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:22:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玫瑰花雨 - 王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's raining roses! - My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯·卡尔佩珀先生求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Thomas Culpepper is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.95,0:22:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 国王陛下谴我来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. The King has sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Culpepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.39,0:22:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下谴小人前来宣旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty wants you to know that you will shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近期您将陪同陛下出巡威廉姆·佩吉特爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}accompany him on a visit to Sir William Paget's estates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}位于伯克郡的领地 望此行令您愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Berkshire for your pastime and disport.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蒙陛下厚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very grateful to His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对此行非常期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I look forward to the visit very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下还颁旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty also wants you to know that he has settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将贝纳德堡赐予您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baynard's Castle on you as your jointure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝纳德堡在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Baynard's Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}位于伦敦 泰晤士河北岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is here in London, on the north bank of the Thames,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.13,0:22:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗利特河塔附近 您在河边就可以看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}near the Fleet Tower. You've probably seen it from the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it that big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 非常宏伟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's a very big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请回禀陛下 我非常非常感谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}please tell His Majesty that I am very, very grateful to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.35,0:23:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信自己拥有了一座城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot imagine owning a castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下对法之举实乃果断英明\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I commend your Majesty on taking decisive action.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢陛下委以重任于舍弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the French and for honouring my brother with a command.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.89,0:23:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也希望您接受此礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty also desires you to accept this gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请回禀陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell His Majesty that…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.97,0:23:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您非常非常非常感谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're very, very, very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀先生 有些话不知当向谁讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know who to say this to, Mr.Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.51,0:24:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但 当我出宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, when I go about,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.12,0:24:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陪国王陛下出巡时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I shall go with the King on a visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.75,0:24:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不习惯众人注视的目光\N{\fnArial\fs30}not so used to everyone looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.55,0:24:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时 甚至希望大家不要看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes wish they would not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.93,0:24:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后 绅士们望您一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, you must give men leave to look,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.11,0:24:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便会敬您为天人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for they will look upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.56,0:24:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由心而生 情不自禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no help for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.47,0:24:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告退 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.26,0:24:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗彻福德女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.34,0:25:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.39,0:25:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你 吻我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. Kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.36,0:25:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.03,0:25:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请吻我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.47,0:25:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.81,0:25:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.05,0:25:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的爱 我的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, my Lady! Oh, my Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.39,0:25:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.84,0:27:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会离宫一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.24,0:27:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱斯利先生会告知你行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Risley will supply you with an itinerary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.27,0:27:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我离开后要举行一次议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also while I'm away I intend to call a meeting of the Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.61,0:27:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有议员必须到会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every councillor must attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.83,0:27:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不容任何借口缺席\N{\fnArial\fs30}or give very good reason why he may not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.69,0:27:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 遵命陛下 - 照此去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - That's the agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.77,0:27:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 我希望在离宫期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, while we're away I intend for work to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.47,0:27:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进行王宫修缮工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the improvements to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.28,0:27:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沿东河 新建一处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be a new front along the east river,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.85,0:27:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主的御用寝室\N{\fnArial\fs30}privy lodgings for the Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.32,0:27:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有宴厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a banqueting house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.03,0:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn this heat…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请重述 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.25,0:28:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 近来有哪些人被囚于伦敦塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, My Lord, who is presently kept in the Tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.75,0:28:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷大人 在爱尔兰通奸而被起诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is Lord Grey, accused of grave misconduct in Ireland;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱尔大人 在加来犯同罪 还有约翰·内维尔爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Lisle, the same but in Calais; and Sir John Neville,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.04,0:28:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 您可能记得由他领导的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who led, as you may remember, Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.04,0:28:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近来北部的叛乱 他因叛乱罪而受审\N{\fnArial\fs30}the recent disturbance in the north, for which he has been arraigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.81,0:28:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另有一位出身显贵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theris also one other of high birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.90,0:28:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后的堂兄 戴克斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}namely the queen's cousin, Lord Dacres.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.60,0:28:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所犯何罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.72,0:28:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 戴克斯大人是位23岁的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, Lord Dacres is a young man of 23 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.42,0:28:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与伙伴醉酒之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}who, along with some companions, and after a drinking bout,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.19,0:28:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殴打一位老翁致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}set upon an old man in a brawl and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的父亲及其他家庭成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}His father and other members of his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.93,0:28:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾致函陛下乞求宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}have written to Your Majesty begging you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在他年少无知 乞求您的仁慈宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the sake of his youth, to show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.73,0:29:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我离宫后 将前三位处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first three are to be executed whilst I'm away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.84,0:29:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}戴克斯大人另当别论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Dacres is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.11,0:29:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他玷污了其高贵出身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has besmirched his noble birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.21,0:29:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行为与贱民犯罪无异\N{\fnArial\fs30}by behaving like a common criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.64,0:29:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他就应与贱民受同刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I intend he shall be treated like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.79,0:29:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游街至泰伯恩行刑场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have him dragged through the streets to Tyburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公开处予绞刑 以儆效尤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there hanged in public, for all to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.40,0:29:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵旨 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.63,0:29:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 何时再天降甘霖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sakes, will it ever rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫福德夫人 萨里伯爵求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Hertford, the Earl of Surrey, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 敢问有何能为您效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord. How may I be of assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.33,0:30:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本以为能在此地面见伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather trusted to find the Earl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.23,0:30:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很快将启程前往法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am leaving presently for France.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.92,0:30:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是军人 我想征求些许建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a military man. I wanted some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.46,0:30:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我丈夫正在议会同国王会晤\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is in council with the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的朋友曾向我说起过您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soneone of my acquaintance has told me about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.10,0:30:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向我描绘了您的美德和才智\N{\fnArial\fs30}painting such a picture of your virtues and your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.09,0:30:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令我不禁期待能有幸与您结识\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I thought to make myself known to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.18,0:30:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我新近才从法国归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am recently returned from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.04,0:30:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在宫廷中密友甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know intimately so few people at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.64,0:30:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 那现在我们就算认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sir, now we are introduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.37,0:31:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若此为您所求\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.89,0:31:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会转告我丈夫 您希望与他会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell my husband that you wish to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.33,0:31:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.85,0:31:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.63,0:31:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些鞋子务必妥善收藏精心保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}These shoes must be nicely put and always carefully attended.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.24,0:31:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 国王来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, the King is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.25,0:31:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.63,0:32:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.19,0:32:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想为您介绍两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are two people come to be introduced to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.23,0:32:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 布赖恩夫人 - 是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Bryan. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.29,0:32:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是我的儿子 爱德华王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my son, Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上前来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come forward, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.83,0:32:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是我的新王后 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my new Queen, Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.58,0:32:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 向她问好 - 您好 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say hello to her. - Hello, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.31,0:32:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是个可爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's such a sweet boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.61,0:32:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.91,0:32:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很高兴认识您 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am so delighted to meet you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.25,0:32:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可安好 吃得可好 酷暑有没有影响到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he well? Eating well? How does the heat affect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.41,0:32:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便酷热如此 也务必确保他穿着严实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though it is so hot he must always be wrapped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.63,0:32:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 以防着凉 - 殿下安好康健\N{\fnArial\fs30}- against any sudden chills. - He is very well and healthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.33,0:32:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的服侍照顾极尽周正无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every care that could be taken is taken for his better comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.60,0:32:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一方面 也不可过分宠溺他\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, don't spoil him too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.57,0:32:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.18,0:32:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做个乖孩子 听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be a good boy, do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.11,0:32:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 先生 祝您日安 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. Good day, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎 伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.96,0:33:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.33,0:33:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 很荣幸能认识您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I am honoured to be presented to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.23,0:33:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝您欢愉喜乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wish you every joy and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能认识您我也很荣幸 伊丽莎白小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is also an honour for me to meet you, Lady Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.86,0:33:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是个非常漂亮的小淑女\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a very pretty young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.52,0:33:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.95,0:33:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要送给您这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to give you these.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不算昂贵 但能让您记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are of not much value, but will remind you of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.80,0:33:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下真是太慷慨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is very generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.74,0:33:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将永远视若珍宝 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always cherish it. Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.17,0:34:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续整理 我们明日出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry on packing; we depart tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. Risley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.63,0:34:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 死刑判决书 赫福德大人 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The death warrants, my Lord Hertford. - My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.47,0:34:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莱尔大人 约翰·内维尔爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Lisle. Sir John Neville.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.75,0:34:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有戴克斯大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lord Dacres.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.91,0:34:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真令人同情 如此年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pity him for his youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.25,0:34:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说法官宣判时都悲叹不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say the judges wept when they read his sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.58,0:34:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑 莱斯利先生 让那些悲叹的法官们省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God save us, Mr. Risley, from weeping judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.93,0:34:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.36,0:35:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵启程前来见过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Surrey speak to you before he left?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.97,0:35:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 自他回到宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Since his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.59,0:35:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位爵爷到处宣扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Earl has made it plain to all who will listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.42,0:35:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说他鄙视我们这些 「新晋份子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he despises us as "New men."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.31,0:35:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看不出来他有何必要跟你打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose that he would deal with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.76,0:35:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有何了不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.99,0:35:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵身世显赫家财万贯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrey is heir to a great title and a great fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.69,0:35:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的家族有皇室血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}His family have royal blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.03,0:35:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然即便是你 也能看出其中的利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely even you can see the merits of dealing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克夏老城堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}贝克夏老城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.67,0:36:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir William?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后与我对您的盛情款待深表感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Queen and I thank you for your most lavish hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下实在是太仁慈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Your Majesty is most gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.77,0:36:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您与王后能造访寒舍 实属莫大的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so honoured that you and your Queen have chosen to visit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.14,0:36:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查德爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我刚从宫里赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. I just came from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.58,0:36:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到法国来的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have had news from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.18,0:36:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然在我到达不久 托马斯·西摩爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, soon after I arrived, Sir Thomas Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.63,0:36:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和萨里伯爵 已按您吩咐 做好了战事部署\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lord Surrey, as you commanded, made warlike preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}展示了我方实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and showed their strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.78,0:36:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随后向法方表明了决议\N{\fnArial\fs30}and afterwards made overtures to the French governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.85,0:36:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双方交换了礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some gifts were exchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.81,0:36:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们还邀请法国方面观赏摔跤比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the French were invited to watch a wrestling match.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.37,0:37:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原本直到近日 双方剑拔弩张 一触即发\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where, until recently, nothing but war had been talked of,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.65,0:37:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而现在却对此互不提及 只望和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}now there is no mention but of wishing to live at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说他们已妥善处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it was all well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.83,0:37:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管如此 理查德爵士 我内心还是有些许失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, Sir Richard, something inside me is disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.00,0:37:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我渴望战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hungers for a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.02,0:37:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去我曾深谙此种疯狂的热望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have known its mad excitements only once,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.03,0:37:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.98,0:37:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有意思 我真心觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. You know, I actually thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.23,0:37:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国人这次定然感恩戴德\N{\fnArial\fs30}the French might oblige me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.87,0:38:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.18,0:38:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否心满意足 万事遂愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have everything you want, everything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.79,0:38:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告诉我 - 是的 别无他求\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me. - Yes, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.63,0:38:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过还有一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.40,0:38:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.90,0:38:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.99,0:39:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主待我毫无敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Lady Mary doesn't treat me with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.43,0:39:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不应如此 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think she ought to, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.23,0:39:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会改变态度 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.82,0:39:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给她点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.91,0:39:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她尚不适应这变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this is new to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.78,0:39:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但最终会接受你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she will grow used to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.58,0:39:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喜爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she will love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.35,0:39:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.50,0:39:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我累了 真的很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired. I'm very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.95,0:39:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明日还要为国事繁忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a long day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 吾爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.10,0:39:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.15,0:40:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.83,0:40:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.55,0:40:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.03,0:40:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你干嘛 - 别担心 我不会久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Don't worry. I won't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.98,0:40:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只想聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.44,0:40:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聊什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.53,0:40:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们过去常这样 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how it used to be. Remember? You and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.52,0:40:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我警告过你 当心祸从口出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to mind what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.88,0:41:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是跟你讲讲嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.04,0:41:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们两个夜里就会进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the two of them would come in,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.48,0:41:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双双对对 神仙眷侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one for you, and the other mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.27,0:41:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑暗中浪声绵绵 娇喘吁吁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that puffing and blowing in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.82,0:41:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们忘情亲吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and him would kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.02,0:41:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莺歌燕舞 如胶似漆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hang by your bellies like two sparrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.50,0:41:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no harm in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都想着以后会结为夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were agreed we were to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.51,0:41:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事你告诉国王了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you told the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.31,0:41:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.25,0:41:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to tell him anything about…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.37,0:41:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何必再提\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.36,0:41:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你胆敢走漏风声 我发誓将…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you talk of it to anyone I swear I'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.36,0:41:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘 我还指望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush. Hush. Do you suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.36,0:41:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}留在宫廷 享受荣华富贵呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like being at court, like a special person?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.19,0:41:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你就以荣誉发下毒誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then swear on your honour, and hope to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.21,0:41:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不对任何人吐露半点\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you will speak of it to nobody,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.07,0:41:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括我的那些女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even any of my other ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.85,0:42:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.30,0:42:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对天发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do so swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.84,0:42:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真心诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.51,0:42:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 现在回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now go back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.77,0:42:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得这轻抚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you remember this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.55,0:42:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我如今贵为王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Queen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.55,0:42:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要听从吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do as I command.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉爵士何其慷慨 敞开酒窖招待我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very obliging of Sir William to open his cellar for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.64,0:43:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为是爱德华爵士你打开的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather thought, Sir Edward, that it was you who opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.18,0:43:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚才饥渴难耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.45,0:43:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此时仍未满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still am!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.26,0:43:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天啊 她还真是放荡 - 说谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By God she's wanton. - Who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.07,0:43:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很清楚我在说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know very well who I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.07,0:43:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳王后 她就是只小野猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Katherine. She's a little fireball.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.72,0:43:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你欲火焚身 卡尔佩珀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too hot for you, Mr. Culpepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.58,0:43:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.55,0:43:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.81,0:43:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就没有想过她一丝不挂的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you can't imagine her without her clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.73,0:43:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玉体裸呈 春光无限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just picture her naked body.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.88,0:43:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}双峰诱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.71,0:43:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美腿丰腴 粉臀娇翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those thighs. That sweet plump little arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.25,0:43:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.88,0:43:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些全属国王私有\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those things belong to the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.11,0:44:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝各位先生晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you gentlemen good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.24,0:44:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}换作我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.07,0:44:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就知趣地离开威廉爵士的厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not outstay your welcome in Sir William's kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.53,0:44:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喝再多酒都无法熄灭对她的欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't drink enough to banish the thoughts of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.11,0:44:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明日我们出去找点乐子 解解渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow let's go out and find something to quench that thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.95,0:44:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好啊 - 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ya! - Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.44,0:45:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 留步 - 先生们 日安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ho there! - Sir, a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.88,0:45:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 你是何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to you. And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.58,0:45:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}守园人的妻子 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife of the park-keeper, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.13,0:45:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你丈夫呢 - 他去集市了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And where is your husband? - He's away at a fair, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.24,0:45:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里可有别人 孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else here? Your children?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.28,0:45:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.17,0:45:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾有个女儿 但不幸夭折 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a daughter, sir, but she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.63,0:45:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里没有别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.07,0:45:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何贵干 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.37,0:46:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能解我燃眉之急 亦能从中取乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do me a great favour, and it will please you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.38,0:46:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这样 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.88,0:46:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道我是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.16,0:46:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我身为枢密院成员 侍奉国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gentleman of the Privy Chamber. I serve the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.54,0:46:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 走 我们进去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, let's go inside. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.02,0:46:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你既贵为上流君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, as you say, you are a gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.40,0:46:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就不要强人所难\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you would not try to force me against my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.07,0:46:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恳请你就此离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would just leave, as I ask you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.50,0:46:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 追 - 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.87,0:46:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.26,0:46:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别跑啊 小母鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, little chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.16,0:46:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟们 上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.87,0:46:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 放过我吧 - 瞧她跑的小样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave me alone! - Look at her run!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.52,0:47:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 到时有你乐的 - 抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! You'll enjoy it! - Take her!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.83,0:47:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.46,0:47:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold her still.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.08,0:47:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.86,0:47:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是守园人罗珀 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Roper, sir. The park-keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.98,0:47:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗珀先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Roper.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.48,0:47:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找我所为何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.27,0:47:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您心知肚明 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know very well what I want, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要寻求公义 我深知你的卑劣行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want justice. I know what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.47,0:47:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此行前来是为将你带至执行官那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to take you to the Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.78,0:47:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 跟我走吧 阁下 - 休得碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come, sir. - Don't you dare touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.62,0:47:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该了解你的长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know your betters.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.02,0:47:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚回你的狗窝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go back to your pigsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.51,0:47:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 我会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.85,0:48:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去寻找能为我主持公道的执行官\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fetch the Sheriff myself, whose justice is better than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.81,0:48:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}省去执行官的麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather not trouble the Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.37,0:48:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使你封口 所需多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you want for your silence?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.47,0:48:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说个准数吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.21,0:48:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正也没实际伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}What real harm was done?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.66,0:48:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收下这枚金币 足以买十二头猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a gold crown, enough to buy a dozen pigs,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.46,0:48:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此既往不咎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forget the whole matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.09,0:48:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.58,0:48:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耻辱将永留贱内\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the shame would still be there in my wife's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.66,0:48:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及我的心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.68,0:48:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}操 你个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you for a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.55,0:49:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蒙您之邀令我倍感惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say I was surprised at your invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.23,0:49:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.69,0:49:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我以为您早已司空见惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had imagined that very little would surprise you, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.35,0:49:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我此生阅历无数 理应习以为常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true that I have seen most things in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.45,0:49:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我发现人们总是惊喜不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I find that people can always be surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.33,0:49:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和你交友 因而邀请你至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invited you here because I want us to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.05,0:49:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何种朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.93,0:49:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.63,0:49:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无人想被诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to be cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.13,0:50:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有所畏惧才会有所顾忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are good when they are afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.43,0:50:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当人们无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they are not afraid…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.62,0:50:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们就会无法无天\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.99,0:50:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳·霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.47,0:51:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.76,0:51:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议员们皆已到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Councillors are arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.82,0:51:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我得尽快沐浴更衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, then I'd better wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.06,0:51:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.47,0:52:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生们 议员们 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gentlemen. My Lords. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.50,0:52:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早奏本 赫福德勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your report, my Lord Hertford?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.14,0:52:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.88,0:52:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您离开期间 伦敦爆发了小规模瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a small outbreak of plague in the city during your absence,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.40,0:52:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过谢天谢地 现已平息\N{\fnArial\fs30}which now has abated, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.23,0:52:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下下令建造的房屋都已动工\N{\fnArial\fs30}The building works Your Majesty requested have all commenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.98,0:52:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷勋爵 莱尔勋爵 约翰·内维尔爵士和戴克斯勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the executions of Lords Grey and Lisle, of Sir John Neville and Lord Dacres.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.37,0:52:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}业已遵照陛下指令予以处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}have all been carried out in accordance with your Majesty's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.85,0:52:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.39,0:52:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.86,0:52:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于牢中那五百名异教徒嫌疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refer to the 500 men kept in prison on suspicion of heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.32,0:52:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依我之意 应全部赦免并将其释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my desire that they should be pardoned and therefore released.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.64,0:52:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下宽宏大度 心系天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty shows remarkable charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.81,0:52:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾理应如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.84,0:52:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾主告诫我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does our Lord not commend us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.09,0:52:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应永怀慈爱和信实\N{\fnArial\fs30}to never to let mercy and faithfulness depart from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.82,0:52:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王子近况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.49,0:52:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 爱德华王子一切安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Edward is very well, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.53,0:53:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王替其儿子 奥尔良公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Francis has formally proposed a marriage contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.84,0:53:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正式向玛丽公主求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}between his son, Henri, Duc of Orleans, and Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.19,0:53:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不应当也不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not, and cannot,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.04,0:53:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轻信弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}trust the intentions of King Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.42,0:53:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他仍意图侵略我国 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and still think he means to invade this realm. - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.50,0:53:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加来事件只是对我们的初探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Events at Calais were just a preliminary exercise to test our resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.10,0:53:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因而我们仍须时刻警惕海岸防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case we must continue to look to our coastal defences.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.43,0:53:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保卫帝国安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}and favour the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.83,0:53:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一个主题是凯瑟琳王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, to the subject of Queen Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.99,0:53:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我意图将先前属于简·西摩的领地与庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my intention to settle upon her all the lands and manors.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.85,0:53:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赐予她\N{\fnArial\fs30}which formerly belonged to Jane Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.19,0:53:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及先前属于托马斯·克伦威尔领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furthermore, some lands and properties formerly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.19,0:53:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}及产业也一并赐予她\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the possession of Thomas Cromwell are also to be settled upon her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.19,0:53:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将宫中其他徽章撤下 用其徽章取而代之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her badges and emblems are to be set up in all palaces, replacing all others,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从今往后凯瑟琳享受英格兰王后待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and henceforth she is in all ways to be treated as the Queen of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.16,0:54:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.75,0:54:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.22,0:54:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.83,0:54:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下雨了 下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It's raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.52,0:54:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.48,0:54:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine. Katherine! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.79,0:54:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下雨了 亨利 下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's raining! Henry! Henry, it's raining!
